{"title": "Gather Power", "pageid": 25027, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gather_Power", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chromatic_Orb_Lightning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Chromatic_Orb_Lightning.webp/300px-Chromatic_Orb_Lightning.webp, /w/images/3/3b/Chromatic_Orb_Lightning.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Chromatic_Orb_Lightning.webp/300px-Chromatic_Orb_Lightning.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Chromatic_Orb_Lightning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Gather Power</b> is a unique class action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a> that causes him to begin building up massive energy. After a 2 turn delay, he will release a devastating <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stormheart_Nova\" title=\"Stormheart Nova\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/20px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/30px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stormheart Nova\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/20px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stormheart_Nova\" title=\"Stormheart Nova\">Stormheart Nova</a>, damaging all creatures caught in the open. This damage can be avoided by taking cover behind <a href=\"/wiki/Attuned_Crystal\" title=\"Attuned Crystal\">Attuned Crystals</a>. While charging up, Ansur has full damage <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistances</a> but cannot perform any other actions.\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Honour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour\">Honour</a> mode, the delay is reduced to a single turn. Additionally, when Ansur is first dropped to 0 hit points in Honour mode, he will remain conscious, gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"100 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 100 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>, and trigger this action again.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nTake flight, land, and begin to gather power.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 30 m (100 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 30 m (100 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Fly_Dragon_Skeletal_EnterFlightState</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Fly_Dragon_Skeletal_EnterFlightState\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Fly_Dragon_Skeletal_EnterFlightState\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreVisionBlock_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreVisionBlock (spell flag)\">IgnoreVisionBlock</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Invisible (spell flag)\">Invisible</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Hoarding_Energy\"> Condition: Hoarding Energy </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Energy_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoarding Energy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hoarding Energy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Energy_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoarding Energy (Condition)\">Hoarding Energy</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Ansur is gathering energy while airborne and is <a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">Resistant</a> to all damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Ansur.27s_Ire\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ansur's_Ire\"> Condition: Ansur's Ire </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ansur%27s_Ire_(Condition)\" title=\"Ansur's Ire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ansur's Ire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ansur%27s_Ire_(Condition)\" title=\"Ansur's Ire (Condition)\">Ansur's Ire</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>A storm of vicious lightning is soon to erupt - striking all standing in the open.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ansur%27s_Ire_(Condition)\" title=\"Ansur's Ire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ansur's Ire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ansur%27s_Ire_(Condition)\" title=\"Ansur's Ire (Condition)\">Ansur's Ire</a> is used as an indicator for which creatures will take damage from the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stormheart_Nova\" title=\"Stormheart Nova\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/20px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/30px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stormheart Nova\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/20px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stormheart_Nova\" title=\"Stormheart Nova\">Stormheart Nova</a> released after two turns. Creatures without this condition (whether because they are out of range or behind cover), will be safe from the explosion.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/20px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/30px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/40px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Globe of Invulnerability\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/20px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\">Globe of Invulnerability</a> is an easy way to protect the entire party from this action.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3734/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 49445/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 19388/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 36/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/